  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p>직접 깨보이지는 못하고 ^^</p><p>유투브에서 찾았습니다~~~</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v40b4iiiXcYsfXfYMRfLMJ2\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v40b4iiiXcYsfXfYMRfLMJ2?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY0MGI0aWlpWGNZc2ZYZllNUmZMTUoyIiwidGlkIjoiYWRlNzQwMjgtMjY0OS00YjcwLTg5ZGEtYWZjNWVkM2NiZjQzIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1ODkxfQ.DB1cZUi4jh0oziwHENYLOjji6g0NxisPntuZlaKpSeBLOTg5b8SyfyhX-0T1ziMGoifV3I8CafiR3iceX9zEdw&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"vaa795Pb9fPff7dzEMdV7J7\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vaa795Pb9fPff7dzEMdV7J7?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZhYTc5NVBiOWZQZmY3ZHpFTWRWN0o3IiwidGlkIjoiYjcyNDE2NDAtZWNiYi00ZGY2LWFiOWQtN2I3NGI0MDYzMTEwIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1ODkxfQ.dRWFx8Xt8SIcY52IhDbMTRGZLp-9z_SbcAdpuj-LfJEpYE6xZwz3XCHfzD8hUwokppbTUUbGaWGh14pb5PO6pg&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t